WEBVTT

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:12.720
The bobbin case, a small cup that holds the bobbin: 22.4 outside, 14 deep, 0.6 wall. Cups, boxes and covers are made with Thickness

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:27.719
First the solid: circle 22.4, Pad 14

00:00:27.719 --> 00:00:30.968
Click the top face—this is where the opening goes

00:00:30.968 --> 00:00:40.220
Click Thickness, 0.6, OK: the selected face is opened and every other face keeps a 0.6 wall

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:52.220
There's the cup, about 787 mm³. The real bobbin case has a 1.5 bottom: Thickness is the same everywhere, so for a thicker bottom pocket the cavity instead (see On your own)
